DT0pU6diUFG.caption:
@karenstintzcpc speaks bluntly about transit delays, disrupted neighborhoods, and where responsibility lies when major city projects go off the rails.

In this exchange with City Councillor @Bradfordgrams, the former TTC chair explains why political leadership matters when construction impacts communities, why bureaucratic processes alone are not enough, and how past mayors handled pressure differently. A candid take on accountability, leadership, and standing up for residents and TTC riders.

🎧 For the Love of TO is a Toronto based podcast hosted by City Councillor Brad Bradford, featuring stories and voices shaping the future of our city.

