DRXIaWpDcqk.caption:
@brettstarke and @bradfordgrams break down why so few new housing projects are breaking ground in Toronto — and why the three year construction pause could leave the city struggling to catch up.

He and City Councillor Brad Bradford dig into rising demand, stalled supply, and how Canadian innovation will play a critical role in solving Toronto’s housing challenges.

🎧 For the Love of TO is a Toronto based podcast hosted by City Councillor Brad Bradford, featuring stories and voices shaping the future of our city.

DRUctvVk5td.caption:
@brettstarke talks with City Councillor @bradfordgrams about why so many Torontonians feel like the city’s best days are behind us — and why he believes the opposite.

He explains the difference between pleasure and real happiness, why adversity brings people together, and how a shift in mindset can help Toronto find its confidence again.

🎧 For the Love of TO is a Toronto based podcast hosted by City Councillor Brad Bradford, featuring stories and voices shaping the future of our city.

DRFGqlJiK4M.caption:
@samibrahim40 tells City Councillor @bradfordgrams why building in Scarborough is non negotiable for him.

He explains why the world’s biggest companies often stay rooted where their founders grew up, and why he wants to put Scarborough on the global map by building a company the community can be proud of.

🎧 For the Love of TO is a Toronto based podcast hosted by City Councillor Brad Bradford, featuring stories and voices shaping the city’s future.

