Spring in the ravine.  The @friendsofglenstewartravine will be hosting our annual cleanup. Tentative date is April 13. More info coming soon.  Our stewardship activities will also start up May 6. This will be our fifth year participating in the @torontonaturestewards program along with a group at @ashbridgesbay Park. We will be sharing info on how to get involved in the next couple weeks. 

For now, don’t be too quick to clean up your gardens. Insects are overwintering in the leaves and stalks. Give them time to emerge.  Plan to attend various plant sales in May or order your native plants.  Follow Cliffcrest Butterflyway or Guildwood Butterflyway and Pollinator Gardens for more info and plants.

